{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-29T21:09:55.362Z","author":"claude-hub","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"0efcf6fa5f6489abf1ec4ce5","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.312","source":"probe"}},"op":"tests_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-29T21:09:55.362Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tests","value":[{"command":"node --test --test-name-pattern='resume notes' test/release-workflow.test.ts","scope":"project","timeout_seconds":300,"provenance":{"author":"claude-hub","created_at":"2026-10-29T21:09:55.299Z","source_kind":"local_mutation","source_ref":"fix/changelog-2026-10-29"}}]}],"before_hash":"2ed5e31516eaa0a97c13bd2e7910295fe86574edc66b1c90a9e12c084f0fda65","after_hash":"c508a67710ac6e75988c02b76b4198eff092bfdb342adaa6928b3e42fc2a25da","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"maintenance","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"d1abf95f4f4e4dbe7464d67dbe5969232a898613ac2bbd2cc669902e9fd0e28e"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-29T21:09:56.658Z","author":"claude-hub","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"0efcf6fa5f6489abf1ec4ce5","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.312","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-29T21:09:56.658Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-29T21:09:56.658Z","author":"claude-hub","text":"Fixed in release.yml 'Restore prepared release notes': when the prepared commit has no section for NPM_VERSION, the step extracts the same-version section from origin/main (fetched and ancestry-verified by 'Verify merged release'), prints a notice, and still fails closed when neither has it. New test 'resume notes fall back to the same-version section of merged main when the prepared commit lacks it' builds a real git history (prepared commit without the section, later main commit with it, detached checkout) and also asserts a version absent everywhere refuses with empty RELEASE_NOTES.md. Revert proof: with the previous step the new test fails, with the fix it passes; release-workflow.test.ts 15/15. After this PR merges, dispatch release.yml to resume v2026.10.29."}]}],"before_hash":"c508a67710ac6e75988c02b76b4198eff092bfdb342adaa6928b3e42fc2a25da","after_hash":"5c41a692d9e2308998be5f75e7db7495bbe195d50464f80973d952401bbdbb45","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"c343d25b2acb08ecb58bace1649b89843e03e6459f2fc16fa28045fe6b5e63d5"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-30T00:14:16.025Z","author":"claude-hub","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"0efcf6fa5f6489abf1ec4ce5","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.312","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-30T00:14:16.025Z","author":"claude-hub","text":"CodeRabbit (Major) on 310e84a: the main-tip fallback read mutable notes. Replaced in this commit: the resume never reads origin/main's tip; recovery needs an explicit workflow_dispatch input recovery_notes_sha (full 40-hex SHA) that must descend from the prepared release (steps.decide.outputs.release_sha) and be contained in main, and only its same-version section is used. Test 'resume notes recover only from an explicitly authorized, immutable recovery commit' (real git: prepared without section, recovery commit, later main edit, side branch, unmerged branch) asserts notes come from the recovery commit, not the later edit, and refuses no input, a short SHA, a commit outside main, a non-descendant and a missing version. Revert proof: fails with the previous main-tip fallback; release-workflow.test.ts 15/15; tsc clean. Recovery: after #200 merges, dispatch release.yml with recovery_notes_sha=<the #200 merge commit>."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-30T00:14:16.025Z"}],"before_hash":"5c41a692d9e2308998be5f75e7db7495bbe195d50464f80973d952401bbdbb45","after_hash":"8edb1d8e150f0ba161bb8a926acb6b55ef9ab27a1cc81b77bf450e7e8a2b6332","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"92bac0a963f1c71a2b7aa725fe7659b6102421904714a28427762c318125bd41"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-30T04:16:49.063Z","author":"claude-hub","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"0efcf6fa5f6489abf1ec4ce5","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.312","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-30T04:16:49.062Z","author":"claude-hub","text":"CodeRabbit follow-up on 8accda1 (2 threads): the recovery test now asserts the real bindings (workflow_dispatch input recovery_notes_sha optional string; step env RECOVERY_NOTES_SHA = inputs.recovery_notes_sha and PREPARED_SHA = steps.decide.outputs.release_sha) and merges the side branch into main with -s ours, so the non-descendant case passes containment and only the prepared-ancestor guard refuses it. Revert proofs: dropping the ancestor guard fails the test; dropping the input mapping fails the test; restored 15/15; tsc clean."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-30T04:16:49.063Z"}],"before_hash":"8edb1d8e150f0ba161bb8a926acb6b55ef9ab27a1cc81b77bf450e7e8a2b6332","after_hash":"7ffb94506bba09f71a8c602831a2450ee90a15762989e0c7ccb29821c57b34fd","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"e182af1fef7c6d276ea9ea5a9f823c2efd0e2c9497b83d7402f6df451bc6484a"}
